# Journey stage 1 played on the 3D board by finger on a DPR-3 phone (swipes): a click
# selects a strand, a swipe routes it through the cells (render.pick on the
# board), a tap behind the tip pulls back, a tap on the spool reels.
# Points are the board's cells at 390x844 (measured from render.ts
# cellScreen; re-measure when the HUD or the framing changes).
# viewport 390x844@3
until 600 =Play
frames 30
touch =Play
until 300 Choose a mode
frames 10
touch Journey.
frames 10
touch Stage 1,
until 300 Reeled 0/3
frames 60
# red: cells 1 → 5 → 9, then 9 → 10 → 11 (its spool), reel
touch 163 356
frames 10
swipe 163 356 161 466 20
frames 10
expect Moves 2 (par 12)
swipe 161 466 296 466 20
frames 10
expect Moves 4 (par 12)
touch 296 466
frames 20
expect Reeled 1/3
# blue: 15 → 12 in one drag, reel
touch 300 527
frames 10
swipe 300 527 90 527 30
frames 10
touch 90 527
frames 20
expect Reeled 2/3
# green: 0, tap 4, tap 0 (behind the tip: pull back), drag 0 → 8, reel
touch 100 356
frames 10
touch 97 409
frames 10
expect Moves 10 (par 12)
touch 100 356
frames 10
expect Moves 10 (par 12)
swipe 100 356 94 466 20
frames 10
touch 94 466
until 300 Total
frames 10
expect Board complete!
expect 13 moves (par 12) · 0 hints
expect =1775
